  "title": "House Robber",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "summary": "At each house choose the better of skipping it (keep the previous best) or robbing it (best from two houses back plus this house's value).",
  "problem": "Rob houses along a street for the maximum total, but you cannot rob two adjacent houses. Return the most you can take.",
